  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "common_2020_koori_020_koori_01a",
      "hash64": "C09C981A1D630235",
      "text": "對[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳而言，這真是幸運的天氣。\\n是雪山想展現溫柔的一面嗎？[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 1,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "common_2020_koori_020_koori_01b",
      "hash64": "C09C951A1D62FD1C",
      "text": "這對[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳而言真是倒楣透頂。\\n看來雪山是站在我這一邊的。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "common_2020_koori_020_koori_02",
      "hash64": "9157825018C8E663",
      "text": "一年當中會有幾次\\n像這樣的聯盟視察。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "common_2020_koori_020_koori_03",
      "hash64": "9157815018C8E4B0",
      "text": "要是在這測驗中無法發揮稱職的實力，\\n就會被撤下道館館主的職位。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "common_2020_koori_020_koori_04",
      "hash64": "9157885018C8F095",
      "text": "……雖然也慈說\\n這只是形式上的例行公事……[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "common_2020_koori_020_koori_05",
      "hash64": "9157875018C8EEE2",
      "text": "要是在身為單板滑雪選手的夢想破碎後，\\n連剩下的才能也都被否定的話，\\r\\n那我還能剩下什麼？[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "common_2020_koori_020_koori_06",
      "hash64": "9157865018C8ED2F",
      "text": "雖然我說了些冷颼颼的話，\\n不過……其實事情沒那麼複雜。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "common_2020_koori_020_koori_07",
      "hash64": "9157855018C8EB7C",
      "text": "我只要讓[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳冷到徹骨，\\n凍到體無完膚就是了。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "common_2020_koori_020_koori_08",
      "hash64": "91578C5018C8F761",
      "text": "也慈也真是壞心。\\n竟然派了一個我絕對打不贏的對手來。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "common_2020_koori_020_koori_09",
      "hash64": "91578B5018C8F5AE",
      "text": "但我並不後悔。\\n我自認是使盡了所有實力。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "common_2020_koori_020_koori_10",
      "hash64": "9153FE5018C5D040",
      "text": "我全心全力對抗[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳，並且輸了……\\n這讓我感到不甘心。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "common_2020_koori_020_koori_11",
      "hash64": "9153FF5018C5D1F3",
      "text": "讓我想要再更認真點\\n來擔任道館館主。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "common_2020_koori_020_koori_12",
      "hash64": "9154005018C5D3A6",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳再次點燃了\\n我那冷卻已久的熱情。\\r\\n……謝謝[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳，[VAR 0x0100(0000)]。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
